WHAT V5 TOOK AWAY

  The six-row stat block leaves both battle panels. Stat stages render as V2
  chips instead, and only when they are not zero. The player's six stats are a
  tap away in the party drawer; the opponent's are now the archetype label
  alone. That is the plan's own budget. It would cost the budget nothing to
  give back, because the panels are overlaid rather than stacked — see the
  report's V5.3 section.
